 we contact to help with this in the town of Chimmney Rock. Any comments on how to accomlish this would be appreicated. Reply to padddlehead7 @yahoo.com","user":null}],"photos":[{"id":"9809","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"4241","description":"Neat little slot move. Start left hit tongue w/Right angle and have speed. Get ready for ender and a good brace. Try to hit eddy on right to set up next rapid. ","caption":"Slot","poi_name":"Slot ?","subject":"Lower Rocky Broad","author":"Mike Lews","poi_id":"102387","photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/9809","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/9809"}},{"id":"nlI7s7jSEWYrCgTJZdRHm","ext":"jpg","post_id":"8v2k9nfpLMm4lBcIEgnBi","description":"<p>The damage to private property and stream banks is epic.</p>","caption":"Temporary road and erosion","poi_name":null,"subject":"","author":"Kevin Colburn","poi_id":null,"photo_date":"2025-05-07T14:29:28.000Z","updated_at":"2025-05-08T14:29:29.000Z","url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/nlI7s7jSEWYrCgTJZdRHm","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/nlI7s7jSEWYrCgTJZdRHm"}},{"id":"WBVr7kaIw14fw85JzJKR4","ext":"jpg","post_id":"8v2k9nfpLMm4lBcIEgnBi","description":"","caption":"Old Bridge in Bat Cave. ","poi_name":null,"subject":"","author":"Kevin Colburn","poi_id":null,"photo_date":"2025-05-07T14:29:28.000Z","updated_at":"2025-05-08T14:29:29.000Z","url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/WBVr7kaIw14fw85JzJKR4","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/WBVr7kaIw14fw85JzJKR4"}},{"id":"QSvS2mAtJYP7ZFIhwCAw4","ext":"jpg","post_id":"8v2k9nfpLMm4lBcIEgnBi","description":"<p>Typical scene including debris, the &quot;Sand Road&quot; that DOT is using for construction travel and access, and the still impressive views of the park.</p>","caption":"Man-made channel with Chimney Rock in the background","poi_name"