ll,"photo_date":"2025-05-07T14:29:28.000Z","updated_at":"2025-05-08T14:29:29.000Z","url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/Y0reoVV72FXDw0OE7cg1b","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/Y0reoVV72FXDw0OE7cg1b"}},{"id":"ZlZP3pF3Rgk0CWZj9smwM","ext":"jpg","post_id":"8v2k9nfpLMm4lBcIEgnBi","description":"<p>Here, at the winery, we discussed the channelized river and how little structure is in it currently compared to the natural river.</p>","caption":"Discussing channelized river","poi_name":null,"subject":"","author":"Kevin Colburn","poi_id":null,"photo_date":"2025-05-07T14:29:28.000Z","updated_at":"2025-05-08T14:29:28.000Z","url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/ZlZP3pF3Rgk0CWZj9smwM","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/ZlZP3pF3Rgk0CWZj9smwM"}},{"id":"Oev9IzrFpY2aEIowmdiaf","ext":"jpg","post_id":"8v2k9nfpLMm4lBcIEgnBi","description":"","caption":"Efforts to reclaim property","poi_name":null,"subject":"","author":"Kevin Colburn","poi_id":null,"photo_date":"2025-05-07T14:29:28.000Z","updated_at":"2025-05-08T14:29:29.000Z","url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/Oev9IzrFpY2aEIowmdiaf","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/Oev9IzrFpY2aEIowmdiaf"}},{"id":"RV3r7ZbJhoRpyD5vSkFpE","ext":"jpg","post_id":"8v2k9nfpLMm4lBcIEgnBi","description":"<p>This short section of the river still looks good, and is reportedly really good.</p>","caption":"Section in good shape","poi_name":null,"subject":"","author":"Kevin Colburn","poi_id":null,"photo_date":"2025-05-07T14:29:28.000Z","updated_at":"2025-05-08T14:29:29.000Z","url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/RV3r7ZbJhoRpyD5vSkFpE","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/RV3r7ZbJhoRpyD5vSkFpE"}},{"id":"yocrW83QvnxFb90LthofB","ext":"jpg","post_id":"8v2k9nfpLMm4lBcIEgnBi","description":"<p>This is an example of a less impacted