{"id":"688650","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"688651","description":"Here you can see the rapid named A-Frame and the reason for its name. The river was running at 3.9 Feet in this photo. A very manageable drop at this level. ","caption":"A-Frame Rapid","poi_name":null,"subject":null,"author":null,"poi_id":null,"photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/688650","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/688650"}},{"id":"9810","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"4241","description":"You'll see an A-Frame house hanging over river. Scout on left. Watch for logs. Stay left hit cool boof. Eddies around. You'll be going under rock hanging over river. Rock pile at bottom. ","caption":"A-Frame","poi_name":"A-Frame","subject":"Lower Rocky Broad","author":"Mike Lewis","poi_id":"102371","photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/9810","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/9810"}},{"id":"9811","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"4241","description":"Last major rapid on river. You'll see a big yellow house on left. Start on river right, hit boof. Punch holes, work your way to the left. Watch out for sticky hole at bottom.","caption":"Last Rapid","poi_name":"Last Rapid ?","subject":"Lower Rocky Broad","author":"Mike Lewis","poi_id":"102387","photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/9811","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/9811"}},{"id":"413996","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"413984","description":"","caption":"Below the Squeeze","poi_name":"","subject":"","author":"Royce Cowan","poi_id":null,"photo_date":null,"updated_at":null,"url":{"medium":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/medium/413996","large":"https://api.americanwhitewater.org/image/images/big/413996"}},{"id":"12235","ext":"jpeg","post_id":"5683","description":"Put-In parking is at a pre